    "raw": "\u2714 Schwarzschild radius is about 2.95325 km per solar mass (0.857842ms)\n\u2714 five presets: 5, 30, 1,000, 1 million, 1 billion; not five classes (0.687186ms)\n\u2714 reference examples carry the handoff masses, status labels and sources (0.354645ms)\n\u2714 sizes scale linearly with mass and keep horizon, shadow and disk distinct (0.199962ms)\n\u2714 nearest example stays inside the same class (0.381655ms)\n\u2714 formatting: masses, km and AU (16.626864ms)\n\u2714 simulated black holes are labelled in model units, never solar or Earth masses (0.531511ms)\n\u2714 the reference catalog never feeds the solver (0.274263ms)\n(node:13) ExperimentalWarning: stripTypeScriptTypes is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n\u2714 SC6-K1: a normal Kids tap places exactly one object and consumes the arm (3.04067ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K1: every cancellation during a held touch places nothing on release (8.187344ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K1: an armed drag past 8 px places one object; adult Add is preserved (4.222522ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K1: placement gate rejects stale epochs and unarmed Kids (0.226511ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K2: query-driven Kids start runs after the adult startup defaults (0.280443ms)\n\u2714 grown-up dialog: a click counts only if the press began in the dialog or came from the keyboard (0.386262ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K3: dialog authorization belongs to the originating pointer, not the latest press (0.201003ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K3: canceled, consumed and reused gestures keep no stale permission (0.299752ms)\n\u2714 SC6-K3: the dialog resets press authorization when it opens and closes (0.387804ms)\n\u2714 SC6-O2: irrelevant and completed pointer records stay bounded (2.72832ms)\n\u2714 SC6-O2: presses are recorded only while Kids mode shows the grown-up dialog (2.858716ms)\n\u2714 kids gate: only the kids bar and grown-up dialog are operable (1.211825ms)\n\u2714 kids keys: focus/activation/Escape and